  "zh": "# 今日全球热点汇总：AI 突破、科技波动与社会民生热议\n\n## AI 与科技\n- **Anthropic 营收突破810亿美元**：Anthropic 报告年化营收达810亿美元，显示 AI 商业化加速，市场需求强劲。\n- **Gemini 4 Carbon 开放**：Google 发布 Gemini 4 Carbon，提升多模态能力，推动 AI 在工业和创意领域应用。\n\n## 科技产品\n- **RTX 5080 跌4000元**：英伟达 RTX 5080 显卡价格大幅下跌，反映市场竞争加剧和供应链调整。\n- **AMD Zen 6 性能提升**：AMD 发布 Zen 6 处理器，吞吐量显著提升，挑战英伟达在高性能计算领域的领先地位。\n\n## 行业动向\n- **金鸡奖最佳导演爆冷**：《金鸡最佳导演》新晋影星获奖，引发行业关于评审权和观众偏好的讨论。\n\n## 社会民生\n- **扬州地震救援响应**：11月11日扬州 3.9 级地震，全国响应迅速，救援行动展现社会凝聚力。\n\n## 国际视野\n- **央视曝光外卖短视频**：央视曝光“取消外卖”短视频系乱象，引发对商业短视频行业监管的讨论。",
  "en": "# Global Hotspots Daily Report: AI Breakthroughs, Tech Products & Social Issues\n\n## AI & Technology\n- **Anthropic 810B revenue**: Anthropic reports $810 billion annual revenue, signaling strong AI market demand and investment momentum.\n- **Gemini 4 Carbon launch**: Google opens Gemini 4 Carbon, enhancing multimodal capabilities and driving AI adoption in industrial sectors.\n\n## Tech Products\n- **RTX 5080 price drop**: Nvidia's RTX 5080 graphics card falls 4000 yuan, reflecting market competition and supply chain adjustments.\n- **AMD Zen 6 performance**: AMD releases Zen 6 processor with significant throughput boost, challenging Nvidia's high-performance computing leadership.\n\n## Industry Trends\n- **Golden Eagle Award upstart**: Best Director at Golden Eagle Awards surprises the industry, sparking debate on jury bias and audience preferences.\n\n## Social Issues\n- **Yangzhou earthquake response**: The 3.9 magnitude earthquake in Yangzhou on Nov 11 triggers nationwide concern and effective relief operations.\n\n## International Outlook\n- **CCTV exposes short video crew**: CCTV highlights the \"cancel delivery\" short video crew's behavior, prompting discussions on commercial short video regulation."
